// a pool of 18 stems runs staggered generations, so at any instant some are germinating, some are
// racing, some are drying to gold and being pruned to free the lattice for the next shoot. Nothing
// ever converges. The motion floor is botanical rather than decorative: free apices CIRCUMNUTATE
// (real tendrils sweep circles hunting for support) at incommensurate rates, every leaf flutters on
